Vintage Disney Princess banner ✨ I used these old thrifted books 📚 which had writing inside of them to cut out flags and then strung them together on a ribbon. 🎀 I added 2 birds and tulle to each side and now I have a vintage princess banner. Stay tuned to see more Princess party decor with a bit of a thrifted / vintage twist. 💕
